WEBVTT

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:14.000
My mother had written me a pink letter with instructions —

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:18.000
for who'd become my mother, and who'd be my father.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Why are we here on Earth? To give life.

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:46.500
This is one of my favorites.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:50.500
The painting you made of mommy's launch on the rocket.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.500
I love you guys.

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:00.500
I should've drove safer.

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:03.000
I should've gone slower.

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:11.000
When you miss something, you really begin to realize how much you love it.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:25.000
Mom has had to suffer so much because of me.

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:29.500
But she's my mother, I guess it's her job.

00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:41.500
[On-screen text] Coming soon
